    metaTitle: "LSA App Shutdown: What to Do Now",
    excerpt: "How to manage Local Services Ads effectively after the dedicated mobile app's retirement.",
    metaDescription: "Google shut down the dedicated Local Services Ads mobile app. Here's how businesses can manage leads, messages, and budgets effectively without it going forward.",
    category: "Marketing Channels",
    readTime: "7 min read",
    publishedDate: "2026-08-10",
